<section class="ps-native-banner"><div class="ps-native-kicker">PISHIELD // SENTINEL ACTION ENGINE</div><h2>Defense command &amp; control</h2><p>Enforce maintained malware and phishing lists · Review evidence · Reverse actions</p></section>
<div class="box box-primary"><div class="box-header with-border"><h3 class="box-title">01 / Operating mode</h3></div><div class="box-body"><p id="ps8-status" role="status">Loading defense engine…</p><p id="ps8-summary"></p><p id="ps8-mode"></p><button id="ps8-observe" class="btn btn-default">Observation</button> <button id="ps8-active" class="btn btn-primary">Active defense</button> <button id="ps8-aggressive" class="btn btn-warning">Aggressive defense</button> <button id="ps8-refresh" class="btn btn-default">Refresh threat feed</button><p>Active uses the HaGeZi TIF Mini list; aggressive uses TIF Medium. Both may have false positives. Default-group clients only. Observation disables PiShield-owned threat lists and removes its owned deny rules; existing filtering and explicit allow rules remain.</p><p id="ps8-result" role="status"></p></div></div>
<div class="box box-primary"><div class="box-header with-border"><h3 class="box-title">02 / Enforced threat feeds</h3></div><div class="box-body"><p id="ps8-freshness"></p><div id="ps8-feeds"></div><p>Feed counts come from the DNS engine. Successful list rebuilds do not imply every request was blocked.</p><div id="ps8-hits"></div></div></div>
<div class="box box-primary"><div class="box-header with-border"><h3 class="box-title">03 / Approve a defensive rule</h3></div><div class="box-body"><label for="ps8-domain">Exact domain (from an investigation or AI recommendation)</label><input id="ps8-domain" class="form-control" placeholder="example.com" maxlength="253"><label for="ps8-duration">Deny duration</label><select id="ps8-duration" class="form-control"><option value="3600">1 hour</option><option value="86400">24 hours</option><option value="permanent">Until removed</option></select><p></p><button id="ps8-deny" class="btn btn-danger">Approve &amp; block</button> <button id="ps8-allow" class="btn btn-default">Add exact allow exception</button> <a class="btn btn-default" href="<?=webhome?>pishield-ai">Open AI reports</a><p>Exceptions use native allow rules in the default group and can override other filtering too. Temporary deny entries expire on the next engine tick; a separate threat feed may still block the name.</p><div id="ps8-rules"></div></div></div>
<div class="box box-primary"><div class="box-header with-border"><h3 class="box-title">04 / Defense action log</h3></div><div class="box-body"><div id="ps8-log"></div></div></div>
<script src="<?=pihole.fileversion('scripts/js/pishield-action.js')?>"></script>
